    Description:
    Refactor the control message receiving mechanism from blocking recv
    (MSG_WAITALL) to non-blocking recv (MSG_DONTWAIT) with a per-connection
    receive buffer and state machine (IDLE -> HDR -> BODY).
    1. Replace blocking recv_msg_hdr/recv_msg_ext_hdr_and_body with
       non-blocking try_recv_nonblocking using persistent per-connection buffer.
    2. Introduce dlock_recv_state_t state machine for incremental message
       assembly.
    3. Support processing multiple messages per epoll event (up to
       DLOCK_MAX_MSG_PER_EVENT).
    
    Key changes:
    * dlock_connection.h: add recv state enum and buffer management
    * dlock_connection.cpp: implement recv buffer management methods
    * dlock_server.h: replace blocking recv with non-blocking methods
    * dlock_server.cpp: rewrite msg processing with non-blocking recv

